    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short and easy hidden object game. 50 cats are hidden amongst this hand-drawn picture with plants, arcade cabinets and even a cuddly koala.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208630/extras/6ced5f62422752cc23cf9b198593f6a7.avif?t=1755218097\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and zoom around the picture using your mouse to find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208630/extras/816d14a1cc24496647535f90ceb59389.avif?t=1755218097\" width=548 height=500 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short and easy hidden object game. 50 cats are hidden amongst this hand-drawn picture with plants, arcade cabinets and even a cuddly koala.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208630/extras/6ced5f62422752cc23cf9b198593f6a7.avif?t=1755218097\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and zoom around the picture using your mouse to find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208630/extras/816d14a1cc24496647535f90ceb59389.avif?t=1755218097\" width=548 height=500 /></span></p>",
